    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kollywood: The Game is a stop motion video, comedy game with quick-time event fight scenes inspired by Tamil Cinema.</strong><br><br><br><strong>Synopsis:</strong> It's been a long day for Baasha as he is watching a Tamil movie, sitting on his living room couch. He falls asleep on his couch... and in that moment, his life is changed forever. Taken from his living room and dropped into the world of Tamil Cinema, Baasha has to work his way through the movie to get back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Complete the <u>Quick-Time Events</u> (Hold or Mash) to play through fight scenes. Failing QTE sequences will play a <u>fail scene</u> and then return to previous checkpoint. Dialogues are fully voiced in Tamil, with English subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated Gameplay Time: 15-20 minutes</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kollywood: The Game is a stop motion video, comedy game with quick-time event fight scenes inspired by Tamil Cinema.</strong><br><br><br><strong>Synopsis:</strong> It's been a long day for Baasha as he is watching a Tamil movie, sitting on his living room couch. He falls asleep on his couch... and in that moment, his life is changed forever. Taken from his living room and dropped into the world of Tamil Cinema, Baasha has to work his way through the movie to get back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Complete the <u>Quick-Time Events</u> (Hold or Mash) to play through fight scenes. Failing QTE sequences will play a <u>fail scene</u> and then return to previous checkpoint. Dialogues are fully voiced in Tamil, with English subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated Gameplay Time: 15-20 minutes</p>",
